{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達周四任命長期擔任首席財務官的科萊特·克雷斯（Colette Kress）為臨時行政總裁。這位資深財務高管將不得不帶領公司，應對由前CEO黃仁勳突然辭職所引發的動蕩與不確定性。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586244.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T07:43:59.196713+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:27:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:37:14.448696+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T07:37:14.448696+00:00","content_hash":"ff06a7d69b0cf6d2d0b6e579617e97550ffdcd4d12829b102a719af9166e513f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}